<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The persistent chrome bar: the five things that are on screen in every phase, in the same
  place in every phase.

  Everything else in this HUD comes and goes with the round loop - the match panel fades on the
  title screen, the menu hides during a fight, the standings only mean something after one. That
  left the build with no fixed point at all: nothing named the app, nothing reported a frame
  rate outside the developer overlay, nothing said which build was installed, and on a phone
  there was no way back out of a live fight or into the telemetry sheet without knowing that
  three fingers and a key that does not exist were the way in.

  Two thin bars rather than five free-floating labels, because the corners are already spoken
  for by the band grid: the top bar has its own row above the band-top token and the bottom bar
  its own row below the card button, so no panel underneath has to know these exist beyond the
  one token that reserves their height.

  Do not write a double hyphen anywhere in this comment. XML forbids it inside a comment, and
  the way UXML fails on it is silent and total: the importer produces a VisualTreeAsset that
  parses to zero children, CloneTree adds nothing, no error is raised at runtime, and the bar
  simply is not on screen. That cost one full device build to find.

  picking-mode="Ignore" on every element except the two buttons, and the document root is set
  to Ignore in code as well. This document sorts above every other one in the scene, so
  anything here that stayed pickable would swallow the tap-anywhere restart for the whole
  match - the same trap MainMenuView documents on its scrim.
-->
<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements">
    <ui:VisualElement name="chrome" class="chrome" picking-mode="Ignore">
        <ui:VisualElement name="chrome-top" class="chrome__bar chrome__bar--top" picking-mode="Ignore">
            <ui:Label name="title" text="PO RUMBLE" class="text text--sm text--bold chrome__title" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <ui:Label name="fps" text="-- FPS" class="text text--sm chrome__fps" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <ui:Button name="menu" text="MENU" class="text text--sm text--bold chrome__button chrome__button--right" />
        </ui:VisualElement>

        <ui:VisualElement name="chrome-bottom" class="chrome__bar chrome__bar--bottom" picking-mode="Ignore">
            <ui:Button name="debug" text="DEBUG" class="text text--sm text--bold chrome__button chrome__button--left" />
            <ui:Label name="version" text="" class="text text--xs text--muted chrome__version" picking-mode="Ignore" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
